---
layout: default
subject: "[{{idTag}}] Two-factor login enabled"
---
<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">Hello {{identity_tag}},</p>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">
	An authenticator app was linked to your {{instance_name}} account from IP {{ip}}.
</p>

<!-- Warning Box -->
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin: 20px 0;">
	<tr>
		<td style="background-color: #fef3e6; border: 1px solid #f8d4b0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px;">
			<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #9a4d1c; margin: 0;">
				<strong>Security Notice:</strong> If this was not you, ask your server admin to reset
				two-factor login and change your password.
			</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
